data: {"text":"1. The Landlord hereby grants to the Tenant a license to use and occupy the premises described as"}

data: {"text":" Flat No. 304, 3rd Floor, Sunshine Apartments, Boring Canal Road, Patna - 800001, measuring 1100 sq. ft., being a furnished residential flat comprising"}

data: {"text":" two bedrooms, one hall, kitchen, two bathrooms, and one balcony (hereinafter referred to as \"the said premises\") for a"}

data: {"text":" period of 11 months commencing from 15.05.2026 and ending on 14.04.2027, both dates inclusive.\n\n2. The"}

data: {"text":" Tenant shall pay monthly rent of Rs. 22,000/- (Rupees Twenty Two Thousand only) for the said premises, which shall be due and payable on the 5th day of every"}

data: {"text":" month during the tenure of this agreement via bank transfer to the Landlord's HDFC Bank"}

data: {"text":" account as specified by the Landlord.\n\n3. The Tenant has deposited a sum of Rs. 66,000/"}

data: {"text":"- (Rupees Sixty Six Thousand only) as security deposit with the Landlord, which sum shall be refunded to the Tenant upon vacation of the said premises, subject"}

data: {"text":" to deduction of any dues, damages, or outstanding amounts pay"}

data: {"text":"able by the Tenant under this agreement.\n\n4. The monthly rent shall be subject to an annual escalation of 8% (eight"}

data: {"text":" percent) from the commencement of the second year of tenancy, should"}

data: {"text":" this agreement be renewed or extended beyond the initial term of 11 months.\n\n5. The Tenant"}

data: {"text":" shall be solely responsible for payment of electricity charges, water charges, and society maintenance charges pertaining to the said premises during"}

data: {"text":" the period of tenancy, and shall ensure that all such payments are made promptly to"}

data: {"text":" avoid disconnection or penalty.\n\n6. Major structural repairs, if any, to"}

data: {"text":" the said premises shall be borne by the Landlord, while minor repairs and maintenance of fixtures"}

data: {"text":", fittings, and day-to-day upkeep shall be the responsibility of the Tenant.\n\n7. The said premises shall be used exclusively for residential purposes by"}

data: {"text":" the Tenant and his immediate family members only, and no commercial, business, or professional activity shall be conducted from"}

data: {"text":" the said premises without prior written consent of the Landlord.\n\n8. The Tenant shall not sub-let, assign, or part"}

data: {"text":" with possession of the said premises or any part thereof to any third party without the express written consent of the Landlord, and any such"}

data: {"text":" unauthorized sub-letting shall constitute a material breach of this agreement.\n\n9. The Tenant shall not make any structural"}

data: {"text":" alterations, additions, or modifications to the said premises without prior written permission of the Landlord, and any such unauthorized"}

data: {"text":" alterations shall be restored to the original condition at the Tenant's cost.\n\n10. Either"}

data: {"text":" party may terminate this agreement by giving 2 (two) months' prior written notice to the other party, and upon such termination, the Tenant shall peac"}

data: {"text":"efully vacate and hand over vacant possession of the said premises to the Landlord.\n\n11. In the event of default in payment of rent for more than 15"}

data: {"text":" days after the due date, or breach of any other terms and conditions of this agreement, the Landlord shall"}

data: {"text":" be entitled to terminate this agreement forthwith and recover possession of the said premises, in addition to claiming damages and"}

data: {"text":" compensation.\n\n12. The Tenant shall maintain the said premises in good and tenantable condition and"}

data: {"text":" shall not cause any damage to the property beyond normal wear and tear, and shall be liable to"}

data: {"text":" compensate the Landlord for any such damage or loss caused due to negligence or misuse"}

data: {"text":".\n\n13. The Tenant acknowledges that he is a salaried employee of HDFC Bank and represents that he has adequate financial capacity to fulfill"}

data: {"text":" all obligations under this agreement throughout the tenure.\n\n14. Both parties shall comply with all applicable laws, rules, and regulations pertaining to the said premises, and"}

data: {"text":" the Tenant shall not use the premises for any illegal or unlawful activities"}

data: {"text":".\n\n15. In case of force majeure events including but not limited to natural disasters, government orders, or circumstances"}

data: {"text":" beyond the reasonable control of either party, the obligations under this agreement may be suspended temporarily until such circumstances cease to exist.\n\n16. This"}

data: {"text":" agreement shall be executed in the presence of two witnesses who shall attest to the signatures of both parties and the terms contained"}

data: {"text":" herein.\n\n17. Any disputes arising out of or in connection with this agreement shall be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the Courts at Patna, Bihar, and shall"}

data: {"text":" be governed by the laws of India.\n\n18. This agreement constitutes the entire understanding between the parties and supersedes all prior negotiations, representations, or agreements, and no modification"}

data: {"text":" shall be valid unless reduced to writing and signed by both parties."}

